According to a report by Intel Market Research, Global SPC Software Market size was valued at USD 2.45 billion in 2025, reflecting the growing adoption of statistical process control solutions across discrete manufacturing and process industries. The market is projected to expand to USD 4.12 billion by 2034, registering a robust CAGR of 5.9% during the forecast period.
Statistical Process Control (SPC) software empowers manufacturers to capture real time sensor data, apply rigorous control chart analysis, and trigger automated alerts when process parameters deviate from predefined limits. By translating raw production data into actionable insights, SPC tools support waste reduction, improved compliance, and the deployment of continuous improvement programs.
